<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; text-align: center;"><font face="arial" style="" size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style=""><font size="2"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;">Baggage Reference -&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Case.Baggage_File_Reference__c}</font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">Thank you for contacting us.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font size="2"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;">I was concerned to learn that your baggage was wet when you collected it on arrival in&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Case.Arrival_City__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;">. Please accept our apologies.</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">We do ask our baggage handlers to take great care when transferring baggage to and from the aircraft and terminals. It is certainly not our usual practice to leave customer’s bags in the rain for any extended period. It is not always possible to avoid the rain completely. I regret we are unable to offer compensation for water damaged baggage.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">You may be able to make a claim through your travel insurance and I would be happy to provide you with any relevant information required by your insurer.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><b><u>Optional paragraph (dangerous weather):</u></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">During dangerous weather conditions, the Airport Authorities may tell our staff to evacuate the ramp area for safety reasons. This is what happened at &lt;city&gt; airport. We understand it is important for customer’s baggage to arrive in good condition, however sometimes circumstances prevent this from happening.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><b><u>If not offering expenses:</u></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">I appreciate you taking the time to bring this matter to our attention. Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><b><u>If offering dry cleaning reimbursement:</u></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">It would be appreciated if you could send your dry cleaning receipts to us for consideration.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">Once again, we do apologise for the damage to your baggage and thank you for contacting us.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">Kind regards</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">{!Case.Thread_Token}</span></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></div><div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><p style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="text-align: start;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: start;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>